{"id":"grading_precip_24h_light","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：小雨","content":"24小时降水量在 0.1～9.9 毫米之间为小雨。地面持续湿润，但很少有积水。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业"],"keywords":["小雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29","url":"http://openstd.samr.gov.cn/bzgk/gb/newGbInfo?hcno=B6CB35A0BC1F8D33CF0A18F95D0A8AB6"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_moderate","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：中雨","content":"24小时降水量在 10.0～24.9 毫米之间为中雨。雨势较密，已可形成明显地面径流。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业"],"keywords":["中雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_heavy","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：大雨","content":"24小时降水量在 25.0～49.9 毫米之间为大雨。雨势猛烈，能见度明显下降，地面易积水。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业","防汛"],"keywords":["大雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：暴雨","content":"24小时降水量在 50.0～99.9 毫米之间为暴雨。可能引发城市内涝、山洪、滑坡等次生灾害。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","防汛","应急"],"keywords":["暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_heavy_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：大暴雨","content":"24小时降水量在 100.0～249.9 毫米之间为大暴雨。极易引发严重灾害，应启动相应应急响应。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","防汛","应急"],"keywords":["大暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_extreme_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：特大暴雨","content":"24小时降水量 ≥ 250.0 毫米为特大暴雨，属极端事件，可能造成重大灾害。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["防汛","应急"],"keywords":["特大暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_light","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：小雨","content":"12小时降水量 0.1～4.9 毫米为小雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["小雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_moderate","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：中雨","content":"12小时降水量 5.0～14.9 毫米为中雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["中雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_heavy","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：大雨","content":"12小时降水量 15.0～29.9 毫米为大雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["大雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
